                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.632/116: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stockton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-05-27T11:00:00+01:00">May 27, 1931—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 27—8:40 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>42. Ratifications exchanged this morning. Austrian instruments will be forwarded
                    by pouch today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stockton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
